{"id":"ego","lemma":"его","pos":"pron","rank":19,"glosses":["his","its"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f9/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Cinemantique-%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE.wav/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Cinemantique-%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я его знаю?","en":"Do I know him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/42059","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Вы знаете его отца?","en":"Do you know his father?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283400","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"father","l":"отец"}]},{"text":"Должно быть, та женщина - его жена.","en":"That woman must be his wife.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655885","words":[{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"woman"},null,{"g":"wife"}]},{"text":"Ты его знаешь?","en":"Do you know him?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Я его завтра увижу.","en":"I'm going to see him tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274865","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to see","l":"увидеть"}]}]}